AUTHORIZED USE REQUIREMENT
---
This software is a defensive security tool. By using it you represent that:

1. You are deploying it only on systems you own or have explicit written
   authorization to monitor.
2. You are not using it to intercept, capture, or exfiltrate data from
   systems without the owner's consent.
3. You comply with all applicable local, national, and international laws
   governing computer access, network monitoring, and cryptographic
   key handling in your jurisdiction.

Unauthorized use of this software against systems you do not own or have
written permission to test may violate the Computer Fraud and Abuse Act
(USA), the Computer Misuse Act (UK), and equivalent statutes worldwide.
